WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.870
Now shift your gaze to George Catlin
and Charles Bird King.

2
00:00:04.420 --> 00:00:07.450
Their portraits offer a different
visual grammar altogether.

3
00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:09.510
But notice what's missing.

4
00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:13.410
The absent element isn't people.
It's the present.

5
00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:18.490
Instead, they cast their sitters
as if they belonged to an earlier age,

6
00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:23.330
figures preserved rather than portrayed,
suspended outside of history.
